    "bodyHtml": "<h1>About Jurnii</h1>\n<p>Jurnii is the leading commercial intelligence and UX benchmarking platform built specifically for iGaming operators.</p>\n<h2>Our Mission</h2>\n<p>We replace manual competitive research, subjective UX opinions, and fragmented marketing data with near-real-time automated intelligence.</p>\n<h3>What Sets Us Apart</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Operator-Native Domain Knowledge</strong>: Designed specifically around bonus structures, sports calendars, and gaming player journeys.</li>\n<li><strong>Evidence-Based Insights</strong>: Replacing guess-work with quantitative benchmark scores and verified market capture.</li>\n<li><strong>Enterprise Scale</strong>: Trusted by Tier 1 and Tier 2 European and global operators.</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "rawContent": "\n# About Jurnii\n\nJurnii is the leading commercial intelligence and UX benchmarking platform built specifically for iGaming operators.\n\n## Our Mission\n\nWe replace manual competitive research, subjective UX opinions, and fragmented marketing data with near-real-time automated intelligence.\n\n### What Sets Us Apart\n\n- **Operator-Native Domain Knowledge**: Designed specifically around bonus structures, sports calendars, and gaming player journeys.\n- **Evidence-Based Insights**: Replacing guess-work with quantitative benchmark scores and verified market capture.\n- **Enterprise Scale**: Trusted by Tier 1 and Tier 2 European and global operators.\n"
